R=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]
content={
"index.html":'''<section class="alt" id="oxt-expanded"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">OXT inhibition / newest 2026 cohort</div><h2>The original seven OXT animals and the new SF15 cohort must be interpreted separately</h2></div><p>OXT provides an upstream circuit test for social-information use and its conversion into own feeding. Recent recordings extend beyond the original cohort, but actual stimulation states and source identity need to be locked before testing replication.</p></div><div class="model-contract"><strong>Original seven, original shuffle-corrected SRI:</strong> contingent OFF D50 to ON D51, 3.222→2.311, 7/7 decreased, animal-level exact P=.0156; noncontingent OFF D52 to ON D53, P=.7969. The paired contingent-minus-noncontingent interaction was not significant (P=.25). These are not evidence of lasting learning impairment.</div><div class="model-contract"><strong>NEW: SF15 / OXT_NAc_PVH, August–September 2026.</strong> Original Sep-29 MATLAB results were recovered for candidate NAc animals 173/174/179/180/184; ANM305 is a distinct VTA-JAWS design and must not be pooled. The newly created pseudo-days 41–52 are alternated segments from original acquisition days 22/26/28/31/32, NOT sequential training days. Active/SRI odd-minus-even is lower in 4/5 candidate NAc animals (mean −0.887, P=.375). Only the three filename-consistent animals 173/179/180 all decline (3/3, P=.25). Passive/PRI has no consistent effect (P=.875 for five). <strong>These are NOT verified ON-minus-OFF effects:</strong> hardware optical state and source rig labels still need confirmation. Pseudoday42/174 also contains 15 incorrectly grouped ANM173 segments; pseudodays45–46/184 use a rig basename labeled 180. No neural/causal conclusion is claimed from these unresolved records.</div><figure class="figure evidence-figure manuscript-square" id="oxt-new-sf15-figure-v166"><a class="figure-zoom" href="assets/OXT_SF15_recent_opto_provenance_v166.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" src="assets/OXT_SF15_recent_opto_provenance_v166.png" alt="Recent SF15 OXT candidate cohort original Active and Passive SRI odd/even segment audits"/></a><figcaption><strong>New OXT/SF15 results and QC.</strong> A–B, identical-animal Active/SRI and Passive/PRI from original MATLAB; C, all source-annotated subject differences; D, old confirmed ON/OFF effect versus new unverified parity contrast. Animal is the independent unit; * marks source-label uncertainty. The VTA animal 305 appears separately, not in NAc means.</figcaption></figure><div class="download-grid"><div class="download-card"><a href="docs/OXT_SF15_EXPANDED_STIM_PROVENANCE_v166.md">Full OXT/SF15 condition and source audit</a><p>Original days, pseudo-day assignment, experiment grouping and statistical boundaries.</p></div><div class="download-card"><a href="data/SOE_OXT_SF15_new_animal_opto_audit_v166.csv">Active/SRI and Passive/PRI per-animal results</a><p>Sanitized original-MAT analysis with unverifiable conditions explicitly flagged.</p></div></div></div></section>''',
"index-zh.html":'''<section class="alt" id="oxt-expanded"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">催产素光抑制 / 2026 年新增实验</div><h2>旧 7 只催产素动物与最近两个月的 SF15 新队列，现在都纳入分析，但绝不混合条件</h2></div><p>催产素实验检验社会信息从观察进入自身行为的上游调控。新记录涉及不同脑区、不同刺激方案以及较新的实验日，必须在相同证据链中各自回答问题。</p></div><div class="model-contract"><strong>原先 7 只，真实 OFF/ON 的原始校正 SRI：</strong>Contingent D50 OFF→D51 ON，均值 3.222→2.311，7/7 下降，动物级双侧精确 P=.0156；Noncontingent D52 OFF→D53 ON，P=.7969。两种刺激条件的配对交互 P=.25，尚未证明选择性，更不能推断持续学习损伤。</div><div class="model-contract"><strong>新增：2026 年 8–9 月 SF15 / OXT_NAc_PVH。</strong> 已恢复 9 月 29 日原 MATLAB shuffle 分析，重点纳入候选 NAc 动物 173、174、179、180、184；305 属于<strong>独立 VTA-JAWS</strong>，不计入 NAc 统计。新增的虚拟 Day41–52 是从真实实验 D22/D26/D28/D31/D32 的奇偶片段拆分出的分析数据，<strong>并非连续训练日</strong>。Active/SRI 奇数片段减偶数片段：5 只中 4 只下降，均值 −0.887，P=.375；仅保留文件标签一致的 173、179、180 为 3/3 下降、P=.25。Passive/PRI 未见一致方向（5 只 P=.875）。<strong>这些还不能写作正式 ON－OFF 效应：</strong>硬件激光状态尚未独立核实。D42/174 混入 173 的 15 个片段；D45–46/184 的 Rig 文件名记为 180，需复核真实身份。来源未解决前不声称新队列已复制旧七只的抑制效果。</div><figure class="figure evidence-figure manuscript-square" id="oxt-new-sf15-figure-v166"><a class="figure-zoom" href="assets/OXT_SF15_recent_opto_provenance_v166.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" src="assets/OXT_SF15_recent_opto_provenance_v166.png" alt="新 SF15 催产素实验 Active SRI 与 Passive PRI 奇偶片段和来源核查"/></a><figcaption><strong>新 OXT 队列原始数据与身份核查。</strong>A–B，同一动物的主动 SRI 与被动 PRI；C，每只动物的奇数减偶数差值及身份风险；D，与旧七只正式 OFF/ON 结果明确区分。以动物为统计单位；星号表示来源标签风险；305 是独立 VTA 实验，不进入 NAc 汇总。</figcaption></figure><div class="download-grid"><div class="download-card"><a href="docs/OXT_SF15_EXPANDED_STIM_PROVENANCE_v166.md">新旧 OXT 实验的完整来源核查</a><p>原始实验日、拆分日、指标与统计证据等级。</p></div><div class="download-card"><a href="data/SOE_OXT_SF15_new_animal_opto_audit_v166.csv">逐动物 Active/SRI 与 Passive/PRI</a><p>可复核的原始 MATLAB 结果，未核实的激光条件已单独标记。</p></div></div></div></section>'''
}
for name,block in content.items():
 p=R/name;s=p.read_text(encoding="utf8")
 if 'id="oxt-expanded"' in s:continue
 tag='<section class="alt" id="generalization">'
 assert tag in s,name
 s=s.replace(tag,block+"\n"+tag,1)
 p.write_text(s,encoding="utf8")
 print("PATCHED",name,"OXT",s.count('id="oxt-expanded"'))
